eted and 5 dead (historical), 1 blocked, and 1 running. I'm checking for any tasks that haven't been updated in over 60 minutes to potentially mark them as dead, and reviewing the AI collaboration table which shows 6 tasks in various states. The last heartbeat across the board was approximately 16 hours ago.\n\nI notice recvh1G41kHE3w from the 0611 check has a last heartbeat of 1744930260000, which is about 8 hours old. Looking at the actual task records, the main active work is the knowledge asset management system v1.0 deployment by 小柱, though some items from the Workbuddy team appear to be completed or in progress.\n\nThe knowledge沉淀 task is blocked due to Qclaw token exhaustion, and there's a knowledge aggregation initiative that seems to be running. I should update my heartbeat and log a new check record, but first I need to confirm which table the project progress library uses—the records I'm seeing don't have clearly formatted data, so I'll need to check the table structure to understand the field mappings."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lq1ikc7byd7q_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_field","arguments":{"action":"list","app_token":"TeIZbungWasADfsKcnjcogmMnCd","table_id":"tbl0HJYbY1tp3Nyi"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lq1ikc7byd7q_2","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_field","arguments":{"action":"list","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tblt4LNepLsvevNr"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776409998213,"responseId":"0631108ed857f9b0c625649f0f539d73"}}
